# Duet-1024 AVX2

Status: retained for Duet-1024 v2 on x86 AVX2.

Six columns are represented as `lo=[c0..c3]` and `hi=[c4,c5,0,0]`; the
permutation uses the v2 S-box, AVX2 row rotations, precomputed `l64`
rotate-count tables, and a fused `C1` handoff from `f1` to `f2`.

See `../Evaluation_Report.md` for validation commands and benchmark results.
